tusiasmante per un ragazzino di città come lui, ma questo senza considerare l'incontro con Belle, un enorme cane maltrattato dal suo padrone. Pronto a tutto pur di combattere l'ingiustizia e proteggere la sua nuova amica, Sebastien trascorrerà l'estate più folle della sua vita."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Belle and Sebastian: Next Generation","overview":"10-year-old Sebastien reluctantly spends his vacation in the mountains with his grandmother and aunt. Helping them with the sheep is hardly an exciting prospect for a city boy like him - but that is without considering his encounter with Belle, a huge dog mistreated by her owner. Ready to do anything to fight injustice and to protect his new-found friend, Sebastien will spend the craziest summer of his life."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Sébastien, 10 ans, passe ses vacances à contrecœur à la montagne chez sa grand-mère et sa tante. Il doit donner un coup de main à la bergerie, rien de bien excitant pour un garçon des villes comme lui… mais c’est sans compter sur sa rencontre avec Belle, une chienne immense et maltraitée par son maître. Prêt à tout pour éviter les injustices et protéger sa nouvelle amie, Sébastien va vivre l’été le plus fou de sa vie.","tagline":"Nouveau héros. Nouvelle génération. Nouveaux dangers."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iPJAcr6Hnsy9pgf9Tv7XjwFpbLq.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iPJAcr6Hnsy9pgf9Tv7XjwFpbLq.png","language":"fr","width":481,"height":297},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sJdc6IJQweCoCr7xj483I8EUwJF.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sJdc6IJQweCoCr7xj483I8EUwJF.png","language":"fr","width":563,"height":338}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7LNyXfAXXnM2KlRUcthNtcHeNY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j7LNyXfAXXnM2KlRUcthNtcHeNY.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://